ng></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Application Begin : <strong>09/07/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Last Date for Apply : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>24/07/2026</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Fee Payment Last Date : <b>24/07/2026</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Exam Date : <strong>As per Schedule</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Admit Card Available : <b>21/08/2026</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 113.085%;text-align: center;height: 224px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>1770/-</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">SC / ST : <b>590/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / Online Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 197px\">\n<td style=\"width: 190.391%;height: 197px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Cotton Corporation of India CCI Recruitment Notification 2026 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Age Limit Details</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>18 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>Post Wise&nbsp;</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation as per Cotton Corporation of India CCI Recruitment 2026 Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"width: 190.391%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Cotton Corporation of India CCI Recruitment 2026 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #008000\">Vacancy Details Total : 148 Post</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 13.7216%\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 63.5839%\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 113.085%\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Cotton Corporation of India CCI Recruitment Eligibility Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 51px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 51px;width: 13.7216%\" colspan=\"2\">Assistant Manager (Official Language)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 51px;width: 63.5839%\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>01</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 51px;text-align: left;width: 113.085%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Hindi with 50% Marks English as Subject in Graduation Level.</li>\n<li>1 Year Experience.</li>\n<li>Age Limit : 32 Years Maximum</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 51px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 51px;width: 13.7216%\" colspan=\"2\">Assistant Manager (Information Technology)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 51px;width: 63.5839%\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>01</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 51px;text-align: left;width: 113.085%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>BE / B.Tech IT / CS, MCA OR MBA / PGDM with IT / System with 50% Marks.</li>\n<li>1 Year Experience.</li>\n<li>Age Limit : 32 Years Maximum</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 51px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 51px;width: 13.7216%\" colspan=\"2\">Management Trainee (Marketing)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 51px;width: 63.5839%\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>08</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 51px;text-align: left;width: 113.085%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>MBA in Agri Business Management / Agriculture.</li>\n<li>Age Limit : 30 Years Maximum.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 13.7216%\" colspan=\"2\">Management Trainee (Accounts)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 63.5839%\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>08</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 25px;text-align: left;width: 113.085%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>CA / CMA Exam Passed.</li>\n<li>Age Limit : 30 Years Maximum.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 13.7216%\" colspan=\"2\">Junior Commercial Executive</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 63.5839%\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>50</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 25px;text-align: left;width: 113.085%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>B.SC Agriculture from Any Recognized University with Minimum 50% Marks.</li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : 45% Marks.</li>\n<li>Age Limit : 30 Years Maximum.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 13.7216%\" colspan=\"2\">Junior Assistant (Accounts)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 63.5839%\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>50</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 25px;text-align: left;width: 113.085%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Commerce B.Com from Any Recognized University with Minimum 50% Marks.</li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : 45% Marks.</li>\n<li>Age Limit : 30 Years Maximum.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 13.7216%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"2\">Junior Assistant (General)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 63.5839%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>30</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 113.085%;height: 25px;text-align: left\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India&nbsp; with Minimum 50% Marks.</li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : 45% Marks.</li>\n<li>Age Limit : 30 Years Maximum.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 190.391%\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Cotcorp Various Post Exam Cities Details 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mumbai, Hyderabad, New Delhi, Chennai, Lucknow, Chandigarh, Kolkata, Bengaluru, Ahmedabad, Patna &amp; Jaipur Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"height: 25px;width: 190.391%\" c